<speak>The holding I want you to transact in is Summit Global Equity <sub alias="ee tee eff">ETF</sub>. I want to sell from my existing holding. I've kept the relevant papers together in the personal folder beside me. I used to have one large folder for everything that came through the letterbox, and it became quite troublesome. Now I separate bank correspondence from household matters, and the office papers never come into this study unless there's a very specific administrative reason. Otherwise, they tend to spread across the desk and stay there.</speak>